  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in the cataplana vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened.",
    "Add the chopped bell pepper and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Add the sliced frankfurter and cook until browned.",
    "Add the diced pickle, curry powder, salt, and pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cook, covered, for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
